4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p3F8LtZBHMwQ7kNvwFZchde&_nc_oc=AdofZt6JxExJcCttZUfo87G2oMpAFrCFIuN4TXIBd2sdVGE0dFJCw2zwLguDiZmZwOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx4Iwq9fqyB_N7Kay78O4KQWX_gP5l6v_7dilXi7cX5LQ&oe=69C52ED4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t757DALxpV0Q7kNvwEArsyF&_nc_oc=AdruXwDaN28e6a78WyFyiBVL55-6QsuHEsdYOBqcFnLU9qS6gZYRVaattF7_rw2WNZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy2sgiBIaiBXPeC6jMGcHXdFVaenyMaEITm_eJXSeOjJw&oe=69C533B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uudlYoCH4ZoQ7kNvwHxJrYu&_nc_oc=Adrnkg_HZU5_wrgKh_8GRzq9RsEyT_eW80qQgvP99z1eCDOyLTL4qH2CS2YwNXH3WPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwsaT5n0H3ggDBjqLLiqx0qvsn2gS_S5x6FgYoxtouMGw&oe=69C54155"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p